      "hash64": "747FB95472A8FFD3",
      "text": "大家各自一邊吃著點心，\\n一邊熱絡地聊著八卦。[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
